[{"id":"cnm_h215_q1","topicId":"cnm_h215","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"f(x)=x²。从 x=1 到 x=3 的平均变化率是多少？","answer":"4","explanation":"(9−1)/(3−1)=4。","verify":"Fraction(3*3-1*1, 3-1)"},{"id":"cnm_h215_q2","topicId":"cnm_h215","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"f(x)=2x+1。从 x=0 到 x=4 的平均变化率是多少？","answer":"2","explanation":"一次函数的平均变化率就是斜率 2。","verify":"Fraction((2*4+1)-(2*0+1), 4-0)"},{"id":"cnm_h215_q3","topicId":"cnm_h215","difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"路程从 t=0 的 0 米变为 t=5 的 20 米。平均速度是多少？","answer":"4","explanation":"20/5=4，单位是米每秒。","verify":"Fraction(20-0, 5-0)"},{"id":"cnm_h215_q4","topicId":"cnm_h215","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"平均变化率对应函数图象上的哪一条线的斜率？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"过其中一点的切线"},{"key":"B","text":"垂直于 x 轴的直线"},{"key":"C","text":"渐近线"},{"key":"D","text":"两个端点的割线"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"割线连接区间两端的图象点，它的斜率就是平均变化率。","verify":"\"两个端点的割线\""},{"id":"cnm_h216_q1","topicId":"cnm_h216","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"f(x)=x²。从 2 到 2.5 的平均变化率是多少？","answer":"9/2","explanation":"f(2.5)=6.25，f(2)=4，增量 2.25，除以 0.5 得 4.5。","verify":"Fraction(Fraction(5,2)**2-4, Fraction(1,2))"},{"id":"cnm_h216_q2","topicId":"cnm_h216","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"f(x)=x²。从 2 到 2 的右邻点若增量为 0 的极限意义下，瞬时变化率等于 f 在 2 处的导数。2x 在 x=2 的值是多少？","answer":"4","explanation":"x² 的导数是 2x，在 x=2 处是 4。平均变化率会随着增量变小而靠近 4。","verify":"2*2"},{"id":"cnm_h216_q3","topicId":"cnm_h216","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"瞬时变化率是怎样得到的？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"任意一个平均变化率"},{"key":"B","text":"函数值本身"},{"key":"C","text":"定义域的长度"},{"key":"D","text":"平均变化率在增量趋于 0 时的极限"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"先算平均变化率，再让区间长度趋于 0。这就是导数里的极限思想。","verify":"\"平均变化率在增量趋于 0 时的极限\""},{"id":"cnm_h216_q4","topicId":"cnm_h216","difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"f(x)=x² 在 x=1 附近，增量 h=1 时平均变化率是多少？","answer":"3","explanation":"(4−1)/1=3。h 再变小，结果会靠近导数 2。","verify":"Fraction((1+1)**2-1, 1)"},{"id":"cnm_h217_q1","topicId":"cnm_h217","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"f(x)=x²，则 f'(x)=2x。f'(3) 等于多少？","answer":"6","explanation":"把 x=3 代入导函数，得 6。","verify":"2*3"},{"id":"cnm_h217_q2","topicId":"cnm_h217","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"f(x)=x³，则 f'(x)=3x²。f'(2) 等于多少？","answer":"12","explanation":"3×4=12。","verify":"3*2*2"},{"id":"cnm_h217_q3","topicId":"cnm_h217","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"导数 f'(x) 是什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"关于自变量的一个函数"},{"key":"B","text":"一个与 x 无关的固定线段"},{"key":"C","text":"函数的定义域"},{"key":"D","text":"函数图象本身"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"每一点可以有一个导数值，这些值又组成导函数。","verify":"\"关于自变量的一个函数\""},{"id":"cnm_h217_q4","topicId":"cnm_h217","difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"常函数 f(x)=5 的导数是 0。f'(4) 等于多少？","answer":"0","explanation":"常函数没有变化，任意一点的导数都是 0。","verify":"0"},{"id":"cnm_h218_q1","topicId":"cnm_h218","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"f'(x)=3x²−3。f'(2) 等于多少？","answer":"9","explanation":"3×4−3=9。","verify":"3*2*2-3"},{"id":"cnm_h218_q2","topicId":"cnm_h218","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"f'(x)=4x。f'(0) 等于多少？","answer":"0","explanation":"4×0=0。","verify":"0"},{"id":"cnm_h218_q3","topicId":"cnm_h218","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"f(x)=x² 与 f'(x)=2x 的关系是？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"两个函数是同一个函数"},{"key":"B","text":"2x 是 x² 的导函数"},{"key":"C","text":"2x 是 x² 的定义域"},{"key":"D","text":"2x 是 x² 的图象"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"导函数由原函数求得，一般是另一个函数。","verify":"\"2x 是 x² 的导函数\""},{"id":"cnm_h218_q4","topicId":"cnm_h218","difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"f'(x)=−2x+4。f'(1) 等于多少？","answer":"2","explanation":"−2+4=2。","verify":"-2*1+4"},{"id":"cnm_h219_q1","topicId":"cnm_h219","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"曲线 y=x² 在 x=1 处的导数是 2。切线斜率是多少？","answer":"2","explanation":"导数就是切线斜率，所以斜率是 2。","verify":"2"},{"id":"cnm_h219_q2","topicId":"cnm_h219","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"f'(x0)>0 时，曲线在对应点的切线怎样？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"从左到右下降"},{"key":"B","text":"从左到右上升"},{"key":"C","text":"垂直于 x 轴"},{"key":"D","text":"与曲线没有交点"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"斜率为正，切线上升。","verify":"\"从左到右上升\""},{"id":"cnm_h219_q3","topicId":"cnm_h219","difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"f'(x)=2x。曲线在 x=−1 处的切线斜率是多少？","answer":"-2","explanation":"斜率是 −2，切线下降。","verify":"2*(-1)"},{"id":"cnm_h219_q4","topicId":"cnm_h219","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"导数不存在，可能对应切线的什么情况？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"切线斜率一定是 0"},{"key":"B","text":"曲线一定没有定义"},{"key":"C","text":"切线一定经过原点"},{"key":"D","text":"切线垂直于 x 轴，斜率不存在"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"例如尖点或铅直切线。斜率不存在时，不能把导数写成一个实数。","verify":"\"切线垂直于 x 轴，斜率不存在\""},{"id":"cnm_h220_q1","topicId":"cnm_h220","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"曲线 y=x² 在点 (1，1) 处的切线斜率是 2。切线在 y 轴上的截距是多少？","answer":"-1","explanation":"y−1=2(x−1)。x=0 时 y=−1。","verify":"1+2*(0-1)"},{"id":"cnm_h220_q2","topicId":"cnm_h220","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"曲线 y=x² 在 x=0 处的切线斜率是多少？","answer":"0","explanation":"导数 2x 在 0 处是 0，切线是水平的 y=0。","verify":"0"},{"id":"cnm_h220_q3","topicId":"cnm_h220","difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"f(x)=x³，f'(x)=3x²。x=1 时切线斜率是多少？","answer":"3","explanation":"3×1=3。","verify":"3*1*1"},{"id":"cnm_h220_q4","topicId":"cnm_h220","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"写切线方程时，点斜式里的点必须用什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"切点"},{"key":"B","text":"原点，不论切点在哪里"},{"key":"C","text":"与曲线无关的任意点"},{"key":"D","text":"焦点"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"切线过切点，斜率是该点的导数。","verify":"\"切点\""}]
